m/contents/{+path}", "compare_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/team-drift/telemetry-stream/compare/{base}...{head}", "merges_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/team-drift/telemetry-stream/merges", "archive_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/team-drift/telemetry-stream/{archive_format}{/ref}", "downloads_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/team-drift/telemetry-stream/downloads", "issues_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/team-drift/telemetry-stream/issues{/number}", "pulls_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/team-drift/telemetry-stream/pulls{/number}", "milestones_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/team-drift/telemetry-stream/milestones{/number}", "notifications_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/team-drift/telemetry-stream/notifications{?since,all,participating}", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/team-drift/telemetry-stream/labels{/name}", "releases_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/team-drift/telemetry-stream/releases{/id}", "deployments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/team-drift/telemetry-stream/deployments", "created_at": "2023-09-18T18:30:44Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-14T03:48:49Z", "pushed_at": "2025-04-14T03:48:46Z", "git_url": "git://github.com/team-drift/telemetry-stream.git", "ssh_url": "git@github.com:team-drift/telemetry-stream.git", "clone_url": "https://github.com/team-drift/telemetry-stream.git", "svn_url": "https://github.com/team-drift/telemetry-stream", "homepage": "", "size": 2219, "stargazers_count": 1, "watchers_count": 1, "language": "C++", "has_issues": true, "has_projects": true, "has_downloads": false, "has_wiki": true, "has_pages": false, "has_discussions": false, "forks_count": 3, "mirror_url": null, "archived": false, "disabled": false, "open_issues_count": 1, "license": {"key": "mit", "name": "MIT License", "spdx_id": "MIT", "url": "https://api.github.com/licenses/mit", "node_id": "MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"}, "allow_forking": true, "is_template": false, "web_commit_signoff_required": false, "has_pull_requests": true, "pull_request_creation_policy": "all", "topics": ["cpp11", "cpp17", "mavlink", "mavsdk"], "visibility": "public", "forks": 3, "open_issues": 1, "watchers": 1, "default_branch": "main", "permissions": {"admin": false, "maintain": false, "push": false, "triage": false, "pull": true}}, "body": "I am currently developing the initial data streaming portion of the C++ implementation of `telemetry-stream`. Once this is complete, I can collaborate with @Swabhan on `data-formatting` in \"ENUT\" as our tasks overlap on this topic.\r\n\r\n# Reproduction\r\nI am on an M1 Mac, and more irrelevantly use VSCode.\r\n\r\nAssuming you have followed the `docs/telemetry-stream.md/Developer Notes`, simply run the following:\r\n``` \r\ncd cpp # or just ensure you're inside the cpp folder\r\ncmake -Bbuild -H.\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Actual Output\r\n<details>\r\n-- Configuring done (0.1s)\r\nCMake Error at CMakeLists.txt:18 (target_link_libraries):\r\n  Target \"telemetry-stream\" links to:\r\n\r\n    MAVSDK::mavsdk_telemetry\r\n\r\n  but the target was not found.  Possible reasons include:\r\n\r\n    * There is a typo in the target name.\r\n    * A find_package call is missing for an IMPORTED target.\r\n    * An ALIAS target is missing.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n-- Generating done (0.0s)\r\nCMake Generate step failed.  Build files cannot be regenerated correctly.\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n# Possible Solutions\r\nI am almost certain that the M1 Mac OS has something to do with it given my (@BumbleIV) previous experience dealing with almost-exact issues like this.\r\n\r\n1. We could simply comment out `MAVSDK::mavsdk_telemetry` however that is almost certainly needed based off [this documentation](https://mavsdk.mavlink.io/main/en/cpp/guide/telemetry.html).\r\n\r\n\r\n2. [Building MAVSDK Library from Source](https://mavsdk.mavlink.io/main/en/cpp/guide/build.html) however I think it's irrelevant. Though for future reference, we may want to consider building from source since it could be faster. This is a conversation to have with @OwenCochell. \r\n\r\n3. Post on [MAVSDK issues](https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues) however that is most likely overkill given the nature of our issue. ", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/team-drift/telemetry-stream/issues/3/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/team-drift/telemetry-stream/issues/3/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null}}, "event": "cross-referenced"}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/1947340933", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2221#issuecomment-1947340933", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2221", "id": 1947340933, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s50EhCF", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2024-02-15T21:07:40Z", "updated_at": "2024-02-15T21:07:40Z", "body": "It's here:\r\nhttps://github.c